{"availability":"available","full":"pranshuparmar/neon-mayhem","name":"neon-mayhem","description":"Free, browser-playable open-world driving game set in the neon city of Costa Rosa, 1986. Steal cars, outrun the police, race, deliver, rampage — or just cruise. Vanilla Three.js, no build step, runs offline.","category":"Developer tools","language":"JavaScript","stars":7,"forks":6,"created":"2026-07-11T04:06:39Z","updated":"2026-10-11T17:10:54Z","license":"Apache-2.0","branch":"main","homepage":"https://pranshuparmar.github.io/neon-mayhem/","topics":["3d-game","arcade-game","browser-game","driving-game","game","gamedev","github-pages","html5","javascript","neon","no-build","open-world","static-site","synthwave","threejs","web-audio-api","webgl"],"demo":"https://pranshuparmar.github.io/neon-mayhem/","color":"#25392f","ink":"#d1e5c5","lastCheckedAt":"2026-10-12T02:05:00.048Z","lastAttemptAt":"2026-10-12T02:05:00.048Z","lastAvailableAt":"2026-10-12T02:05:00.048Z","metrics":[{"at":"2026-10-08T18:25:58.460Z","stars":5,"forks":5},{"at":"2026-10-11T06:12:57.169Z","stars":5,"forks":6},{"at":"2026-10-12T02:05:00.048Z","stars":7,"forks":6}],"technologies":["Three.js"],"overview":{"kind":"readme","version":1,"paragraphs":["Costa Rosa, 1986. A neon open world you play in your browser. Steal a ride, outrun the heat, take a job, buy a condo with the takings. Or just cruise the beachfront at night with the radio on.","No install, no account, no ads · keyboard, controller or touch · saves in your browser and runs offline","A free, fan-made tribute inspired by Grand Theft Auto: Vice City (2002). Everything in the project is original work — the sentence you just read is the only place the original game is named."],"features":["🚗 Drive anything — sports cars, bikes, a limo, an ice-cream truck, a monster truck. Drift, crash, catch fire.","🚁 Fly and sail — a helicopter, a plane that loops and rolls, parachutes, speedboats and a jet ski. Or swim off the beach.","🚓 Outrun the law — five stars of heat: roadblocks, spike strips, harbour launches, a helicopter. Break their line of sight to lose them.","💼 Take the work — street races, couriers, rampages, takedowns, taxi and ambulance shifts, Lola's story jobs, and favours for strangers.","🏝️ Two islands — the neon mainland, and Isla Verde across the channel once you've earned the bridges."],"sourceUrl":"https://github.com/pranshuparmar/neon-mayhem/blob/main/README.md","fingerprint":"71139d2c727bc9a5d21043fe21d50460f602269ae5abfc9a897f3e4ddb56c40e","extractedAt":"2026-10-12T02:05:00.183Z"},"overviewCheckedAt":"2026-10-12T02:05:00.183Z","projectInsights":{"version":1,"whatItDoes":{"text":"Costa Rosa, 1986. A neon open world you play in your browser. Steal a ride, outrun the heat, take a job, buy a condo with the takings. Or just cruise the beachfront at night with the radio on.","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/pranshuparmar/neon-mayhem/blob/main/README.md"},"audience":[],"requirements":[{"kind":"account","status":"documented","text":"▶ PLAY NOW — free, in your browser No install, no account, no ads · keyboard, controller or touch · saves in your browser and runs offline","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/pranshuparmar/neon-mayhem/blob/main/README.md"}],"fingerprint":"71139d2c727bc9a5d21043fe21d50460f602269ae5abfc9a897f3e4ddb56c40e","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/pranshuparmar/neon-mayhem/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-12T02:05:00.183Z"},"overviewRepoUpdated":"2026-10-11T17:10:54Z","readmeSnapshot":{"version":1,"status":"saved","sourceUrl":"https://github.com/pranshuparmar/neon-mayhem/blob/main/README.md","checkedAt":"2026-10-12T02:05:00.184Z","hash":"71139d2c727bc9a5d21043fe21d50460f602269ae5abfc9a897f3e4ddb56c40e","originalBytes":9155,"storedBytes":9155,"truncated":false,"searchTerms":["lola","city","every","game","open","own","rico","run","stick","take","verde","ask","isla","neon","off","two","when","analytics","around","back","camera","controls","day","docs","drive","each","face","film","fire","